{"start": 0.11, "end": 2.41, "speaker": "S01", "text": "So, what is the difference?"}
{"start": 2.75, "end": 4.99, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Between a madman and a genius."}
{"start": 5.0, "end": 5.06, "speaker": "S00", "text": "S"}
{"start": 6.88, "end": 7.6899999999999995, "speaker": "S01", "text": "Success."}
{"start": 10.809999999999999, "end": 12.0, "speaker": "S02", "text": "The following is a conversation."}
{"start": 12.1, "end": 14.459999999999999, "speaker": "S02", "text": "...with Javier Malley, the president."}
{"start": 14.76, "end": 15.64, "speaker": "S02", "text": "of Argentina."}
{"start": 15.93, "end": 16.169999999999998, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Yeah."}
{"start": 16.35, "end": 18.65, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He is a libertarian, a narco-"}
{"start": 18.73, "end": 20.85, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Capitalist and economist."}
{"start": 21.23, "end": 23.23, "speaker": "S02", "text": "who campaigned with a chainsaw."}
{"start": 23.79, "end": 26.23, "speaker": "S02", "text": "That symbolized his promise to slash"}
{"start": 26.29, "end": 28.169999999999998, "speaker": "S02", "text": "The corrupt bureaucracy of the state."}
{"start": 28.79, "end": 29.029999999999998, "speaker": "S00", "text": "\u55ef\u3002"}
{"start": 29.27, "end": 31.61, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He stepped into the presidency one year."}
{"start": 31.71, "end": 34.09, "speaker": "S02", "text": "ago, with a country on the brink of hyperinflation."}
{"start": 34.14, "end": 36.6, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Inflation, deepened debt, and suffering."}
{"start": 36.93, "end": 38.95, "speaker": "S02", "text": "For mass unemployment and poverty."}
{"start": 39.14, "end": 39.26, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Mm."}
{"start": 39.36, "end": 39.72, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Yeah."}
{"start": 39.98, "end": 42.05, "speaker": "S02", "text": "He took this crisis head on."}
{"start": 42.26, "end": 44.699999999999996, "speaker": "S02", "text": "transforming one of Latin America's largest"}
{"start": 44.76, "end": 47.199999999999996, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Economies through pure free market."}
{"start": 47.26, "end": 49.72, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Principles. In just a few months,"}
{"start": 49.76, "end": 52.199999999999996, "speaker": "S02", "text": "In office, he already achieved RGT."}
{"start": 52.339999999999996, "end": 54.739999999999995, "speaker": "S02", "text": "First fiscal surplus in 16 years."}
{"start": 54.839999999999996, "end": 57.239999999999995, "speaker": "S02", "text": "Years and not just avoided the hyperinflation."}
{"start": 57.79, "end": 59.75, "speaker": "S02", "text": "But brought inflation down."}
